<title>USA: Portland, Ore., bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Portland, Ore., bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>CITY OF PORTLAND, OREGON</p>
<p>RE: $19,398,102.05</p>
<p>GAS TAX REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES A</p>
